WEBVTT

00:25:55.246 --> 00:26:00.163
which is why are managers and people in
general so enamored with intuition?

00:26:00.246 --> 00:26:03.121
I think it's because people
don't have an alternative.

00:26:04.413 --> 00:26:08.246
It's because when they try to reason
their way to a conclusion.

00:26:09.371 --> 00:26:11.579
They end up confusing themselves.

00:26:12.496 --> 00:26:18.829
And so the intuition wins by default,
it makes you feel good.

00:26:18.829 --> 00:26:22.246
It's easy to do and it's something
that you can do quickly,

00:26:23.121 --> 00:26:27.496
whereas careful thinking in a in

00:26:27.496 --> 00:26:31.579
a situation of judgment where there
is no clearly good answer,